Package: seurassist
Type: Package
Title: Seurat Assistant Tools for Single-Cell RNA-seq Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("F. M. Betul", "Erol", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fmab.erol@gmail.com"),
    person("Hannah", "Glover", role = "ctb"))
Description: Provides helper functions for the analysis and visualization of
    single-cell RNA sequencing data using Seurat, including scaled feature plots,
    violin plots, QC reporting, cell-type composition summaries, and cross-sample
    cell highlighting on UMAP embeddings.
